# Sample `run` case: summarize revenue per customer, sorted.
mode: run
order: strict
skip: needs `summarize` and `sort` (M1-16)
---- query
from '../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize revenue = sum(amount) by customerId
| sort by revenue desc, customerId asc
| take 3
---- expected
customerId | revenue
string     | real
-----------+--------
c-042      | 1250.5
c-007      |  980.0
c-113      |  402.25
